<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese coast guard and navy vessels are expanding combat-readiness patrols, water-cannon drills and have moved the carrier Liaoning into the western Pacific, prompting alarms from the Philippines, Taiwan and Japan. China is threatening to cut undersea cables linking Taiwan and the Philippines and is suspected of surveying cables near Japan, while Chinese coast guard ships are harassing shipping in the West Philippine Sea and Dongsha waters. The Philippine Coast Guard is delivering fuel to fishermen at Scarborough Shoal, rescuing a ferry off Quezon Province, assisting over 150,000 sea travelers during Undas and formalizing a partnership with the University of the Philippines. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQVTQzT3kxVmMtak9FMGI2bmhlVnFuUkpqUnZtWVE1SFRnaG93UVlOU3ZWQklTRDlqcTFJYTZOQXB1UnkxRHVOSDctN1ZJLTFxVElQeGtFaTRGcXJMZTQ1RGVIM2lXWWNxa3EzWTRNWS1FRWhjZ25BNUY3WnVmeFE3TEFLbi1OZzNQVEhOUFVPaDZ6ZlVaYV81NGVpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNSWt0ckRGSTRCTGpjZHVRYW9KSlVJSFVDSWVibFJqcjlwMWJDRnRjeTg5NXZhQkJETVlfZ1pJMFZ4dXdMY01OUC1TWGI5RHNPWVFDU29TUEowaHRkeUJfWFVMZTA2ZlFlREpDOTR1c2VhRFhuU3NJLXREVE5xZkZQYjZHS1BiOUZiSlB0TE9QWEh4M000MXJ5dmxoOGg1Zm9j?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNM3ZtczNLVGduSTRSSkZ0a2ZlekJEWWFDNWdWNmNOR21KVXE4WmhRYzd0MEMtQmlFV0VqUnlMNUY2WXJKbXd6bUJfZTFWQXlhdTlmV0pURjVmOGY1M3c1ak4xY1dqRUk3cnVMNS1Qdk9wYVRjQld5amhxRFNmVXZDcWFSUmUwZnBDelVHenAtYlF3M3lHOHdXZlNyQ3ZXOEMzMHczOGtZUV9vSWd6cWZ3UWU0cUstNHFMZmlUTWlB?oc